  "description": "GPU-accelerated, patent-clean codecs for .NET where the codec work runs on the accelerator: images (PNG, JPEG, WebP, GIF, BMP) and BCn textures, video (VP9 encode with inter frames, a full VP9 decoder, VP8 and AV1 keyframes, MP4 and WebM muxing), audio (Opus encode and decode byte-identical with libopus 1.5.2, Vorbis, FLAC, MP3) and compression (zlib, LZ4, Snappy, GDeflate). One library on every ILGPU backend: WebGPU, WebGL and Wasm in Blazor WebAssembly; CUDA, OpenCL and CPU on the desktop.",
  "iconFile": "icon-128.png",
