  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.1: lossless WebP writes the same file on every device (integer predictor costs; CUDA, OpenCL NVIDIA and AMD, Velocity, CPU, WebGPU, Wasm); faster WebP (parallel colour analysis, ALPH trial keeps its winner, two-kernel predictor choice, LZ77 copies reused across colour-cache and strategy trials: SpawnGen Save Animated WEBP on an RX 590 -31% vs 1.1.0); AV1 range coder -19% at 1080p; SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.4.40 (Wasm copy fix). Full list: CHANGELOG.md.",
